title: Git status and diff
flow: The staging view lists what changed, Enter opens the diff, s stages the file, and a commit is written without leaving the editor.
open src/util.zig
until "pub fn sum"
record
wait 1000
run git.status_pane
until "Unstaged changes" 4000
wait 1600
key enter
wait 2200
run git.diff_toggle_view
wait 1600
poster
run git.diff_toggle_view
wait 1400
run git.status_pane
wait 1000
key s
wait 1200
key c
wait 900
slowtype "Add util.max for the largest element" 45
wait 600
key enter
wait 1500
run view.activity_git
wait 2600
